 一行式紅線】`python -c` 只能執行小陳述；`;` 之後不得接 if / for / def / with 等複合陳述（例如 `data = read(); if data: print(len(data))` 會直接 SyntaxError，重試多少次都不會成功），且單行內不得放 `#` 註解（`#` 會把同行後續所有 `;` 語句與 `print` 全部註解掉而產生空輸出）。需要多分支驗證或加註解時，把程式碼寫成 .py 檔案後執行；工作區裡已有能算出結果的腳本時，直接執行該腳本。\n計算腳本一旦成功印出與失敗草稿不同的新結果，下一個動作必須是把結果寫入交付物檔案：腳本輸出即結果本身時，直接重定向寫入（例如 `python <計算腳本> > answer.txt`）；寫入交付物之前不要再執行任何驗證命令。"}],"timestamp":1794085658270},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"164137207","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"ls -R"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"lms1004nothink","model":"gemma-4-12b-it-qat","usage":{"input":19141,"output":15,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":19156,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794085658279,"responseId":"chatcmpl-k6u3ojqr1qiilyp0x8i3de","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"164137207","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":".:\nanswer.txt\ncontract.md\ndata\nrequest.md\nrequirements.json\n\n./data:\ncost_data_with_errors.csv\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1794085668712},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<|channel>thought\n<channel|>"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"115197904","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"data/cost_data_with_errors.csv"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"lms1004nothink","model":"gemma-4-12b-it-qat","usage":{"input":19196,"output":27,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":19223,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794085668717,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fsjxnfmx5bht8cre45wbn","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"115197904","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":",name,dates_active,max_storm_cat,max_sust_wind,min_p,areas_affected,damage_USD,deaths,year,damage_imputed\n0,ARLENE,April 19 – 21,1,43.4488,990.0,None,0.0,0.0,2017,0\n1,BRET,June 19 – 20,1,43.4488